# Keeps this directory in git while ignoring everything the tests write into it.
#
# tests/conftest.py chdirs into a per-module working directory when one exists and into the parent
# when it does not, and this module's tests reach their inputs as ../fixtures/... -- which only
# resolves from inside here.  Without this marker the directory is absent from a fresh checkout,
# the chdir falls back to tests/unit/test_sphinxext/, and every test in the module fails on a path
# one level too high.  That went unnoticed because the whole directory was skipped on CI until
# sphinx became a test dependency.
*
!.gitignore
